(4998074, 729228, 83650, '<td valign="top">Looks like Estes Park?</td>', 'Looks like Estes Park?', '2008-10-08 01:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998091, 729117, 75532, '<td valign="top">i hope you have a model release for that butt!</td>', 'i hope you have a model release for that butt!', '2008-10-08 01:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998096, 727245, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of panoramic crops, however, I have noticed that many on the site are not, so you will probably get plenty of comments regarding the size.<br/>I like this photo, the lighting on the left worker is great.  Can''t do much about the one on the right with him overexposed.  Well taken in tough lighting conditions</td>', 'I am a fan of panoramic crops, however, I have noticed that many on the site are not, so you will probably get plenty of comments regarding the size.I like this photo, the lighting on the left worker is great.  Can''t do much about the one on the right with him overexposed.  Well taken in tough lighting conditions', '2008-10-08 01:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998106, 729233, 96881, '<td valign="top">There is way too much noise in this photo for me.  The idea is good, I would have cropped with his arm in the photo which would have also resulted in a more standard aspect ratio, but the noise kills it.<br/>Also, an out of focus background, rather than the white one, I think would have been an addition rather then a problem</td>', 'There is way too much noise in this photo for me.  The idea is good, I would have cropped with his arm in the photo which would have also resulted in a more standard aspect ratio, but the noise kills it.Also, an out of focus background, rather than the white one, I think would have been an addition rather then a problem', '2008-10-08 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
