(4999411, 729041, 99350, '<td valign="top">This is a great representation of ''work'' because spiders are one of the many examples found in nature of animals expending large amounts of energy and skill on construction. Like other animals, they are vulnerable during their work time due to the amount of time and attention it takes to build such intricate designs (especially considering most animals don''t have opposable thumbs or technology).</td>', 'This is a great representation of ''work'' because spiders are one of the many examples found in nature of animals expending large amounts of energy and skill on construction. Like other animals, they are vulnerable during their work time due to the amount of time and attention it takes to build such intricate designs (especially considering most animals don''t have opposable thumbs or technology).', '2008-10-08 13:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999465, 728994, 72318, '<td valign="top">Hi there Jason! ;P I''d probably have cropped it closer for more impact. It lacks that certain oomph you want to see out of a business woman (in a photo on DPC at least) - might be the lighting being a bit flat. Still, it works for me better than what i have seen so far.</td>', 'Hi there Jason! ;P I''d probably have cropped it closer for more impact. It lacks that certain oomph you want to see out of a business woman (in a photo on DPC at least) - might be the lighting being a bit flat. Still, it works for me better than what i have seen so far.', '2008-10-08 13:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999472, 728976, 72318, '<td valign="top">Hehe, been there... (not the physical place btw).  Wouldnt (excuse the use of the word) work too much without the title tho...</td>', 'Hehe, been there... (not the physical place btw).  Wouldnt (excuse the use of the word) work too much without the title tho...', '2008-10-08 13:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
