(4999528, 728848, 72318, '<td valign="top">Oh dear - title will probably get some comments (and low votes) from animal lovers (i have a rather similar story to tell about a chicken processing factory which involved everything working except the bit that killed them :-\).  But anyway - nice job on the photo itself, more "work" than most i''ve seen.</td>', 'Oh dear - title will probably get some comments (and low votes) from animal lovers (i have a rather similar story to tell about a chicken processing factory which involved everything working except the bit that killed them :-\).  But anyway - nice job on the photo itself, more "work" than most i''ve seen.', '2008-10-08 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
