(4999562, 729135, 72318, '<td valign="top">the bell (i''m assuming it is one) is a bit dark and not very well distinguished from the background. Lighting on the arm is good but it gets a bit messy top right :( Maybe a snoot pointed at the bell would have brought it out better while still keeping the lighting on the arm.</td>', 'the bell (i''m assuming it is one) is a bit dark and not very well distinguished from the background. Lighting on the arm is good but it gets a bit messy top right :( Maybe a snoot pointed at the bell would have brought it out better while still keeping the lighting on the arm.', '2008-10-08 13:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
