(4999604, 728749, 3818, '<td valign="top">Love the show, and this is a great moment. The expression on that one woman''s face sums it all up. Unfortunately, it''s not a "great" photo as far as composition goes with all the disembodied heads. It must have been such an emotional high for you to be there. Too bad you couldn''t get a better perspective for the shot, but I''m sure this photo will always be one you can personally treasure.</td>', 'Love the show, and this is a great moment. The expression on that one woman''s face sums it all up. Unfortunately, it''s not a "great" photo as far as composition goes with all the disembodied heads. It must have been such an emotional high for you to be there. Too bad you couldn''t get a better perspective for the shot, but I''m sure this photo will always be one you can personally treasure.', '2008-10-08 14:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
