(4999774, 729207, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice Image - Like the angle but the cutting off of the foot and can are a little distracting. Just for future when I photograph people hands are the most important thing in the frame after eyes for me. Not seeing her hand behind her back looks a little awkward in the framing. Still a nice quirky and thoughtful image. Nice.</td>', 'Nice Image - Like the angle but the cutting off of the foot and can are a little distracting. Just for future when I photograph people hands are the most important thing in the frame after eyes for me. Not seeing her hand behind her back looks a little awkward in the framing. Still a nice quirky and thoughtful image. Nice.', '2008-10-08 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
