(4999799, 728519, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice Image - Great backdrop and props. Wish we could have seen much more of the surroundings. Feel the framing against the guys leg is really a bit too severe though. Needs a bit more room in the frame. Great colours</td>', 'Nice Image - Great backdrop and props. Wish we could have seen much more of the surroundings. Feel the framing against the guys leg is really a bit too severe though. Needs a bit more room in the frame. Great colours', '2008-10-08 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
