(4999849, 728577, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice Image - Really liked this one - Great POV - Interesting angle and some thought has gone into this. The one thing though that really bugs me and would have completed this image is if you had just had the subject remove his shoes! I think the whole thing gets let down because of this - Clearly he is not a life guard as they would never wear trainers on the beach like this and it just makes the whole image look fake with the title. Still a nice shot though.</td>', 'Nice Image - Really liked this one - Great POV - Interesting angle and some thought has gone into this. The one thing though that really bugs me and would have completed this image is if you had just had the subject remove his shoes! I think the whole thing gets let down because of this - Clearly he is not a life guard as they would never wear trainers on the beach like this and it just makes the whole image look fake with the title. Still a nice shot though.', '2008-10-08 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
