(5000090, 729335, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Great sharpness and tones - Like the simple image - Find the dark image to the top left very distracting though against the thumb - Stops this image from popping which it distracting to the eye</td>', 'Nice image - Great sharpness and tones - Like the simple image - Find the dark image to the top left very distracting though against the thumb - Stops this image from popping which it distracting to the eye', '2008-10-08 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
