(5000125, 729351, 57378, '<td valign="top">I kind of like this in a serial killer kind of way! Looks like a frame that would be at the start of some movie. Interesting - Well done for going against the grain - No pun intended - I like the noise in this too. Well done</td>', 'I kind of like this in a serial killer kind of way! Looks like a frame that would be at the start of some movie. Interesting - Well done for going against the grain - No pun intended - I like the noise in this too. Well done', '2008-10-08 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
