(5000178, 729127, 97635, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, I like the thought process behind it. I think that a little splatter on the uniform would have looked really interesting, however the image is great as is. I give it a 8.</td>', 'Cool idea, I like the thought process behind it. I think that a little splatter on the uniform would have looked really interesting, however the image is great as is. I give it a 8.', '2008-10-08 17:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
