(5000187, 729330, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the feel to this and think there could have been some great potential here - I think I would crop the top of the wall to one more set of bricks above the hard hat to make this almost a square picture - I also think this would make a really nice gritty BW</td>', 'Nice image - Like the feel to this and think there could have been some great potential here - I think I would crop the top of the wall to one more set of bricks above the hard hat to make this almost a square picture - I also think this would make a really nice gritty BW', '2008-10-08 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000188, 727377, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Love the colours to this - Almost Martin Parr like. I like the composition but hate the close crop that takes off the pole and bollards - They just seem to be floating now and not grounded which is very distracting. Good ol England!</td>', 'Nice image - Love the colours to this - Almost Martin Parr like. I like the composition but hate the close crop that takes off the pole and bollards - They just seem to be floating now and not grounded which is very distracting. Good ol England!', '2008-10-08 17:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000190, 728214, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and loads of potential for a great pic here but the lond distance to the subject and boring comosition really detract from this - Would have been great to get under those sparks!p</td>', 'Nice lighting and loads of potential for a great pic here but the lond distance to the subject and boring comosition really detract from this - Would have been great to get under those sparks!p', '2008-10-08 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000192, 729163, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Glad you put some movement in here for some added interest - All the other similar shots in this challenge look so set up and staged. Well done for going the extra mile and making this interesting from a not so interesting subject. Like the muted colours too - A much tighter crop from the left would have added some more drama to this. Still nice though</td>', 'Nice image - Glad you put some movement in here for some added interest - All the other similar shots in this challenge look so set up and staged. Well done for going the extra mile and making this interesting from a not so interesting subject. Like the muted colours too - A much tighter crop from the left would have added some more drama to this. Still nice though', '2008-10-08 17:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000193, 729168, 57378, '<td valign="top">I like the POV but not all that wasted foreground space - Nice soft ligthing</td>', 'I like the POV but not all that wasted foreground space - Nice soft ligthing', '2008-10-08 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5000194, 729321, 57378, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a tad too staged - the light swithces behind the backdrop are a little distracting as too is the over sweat - He looks like he just ran the Sahara not take a picture!</td>', 'Maybe just a tad too staged - the light swithces behind the backdrop are a little distracting as too is the over sweat - He looks like he just ran the Sahara not take a picture!', '2008-10-08 17:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
