(5001363, 729341, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the officer, and placement of the bike. I think a tighter crop  up top would have removed the disorienting line of the windows.</td>', 'I like the officer, and placement of the bike. I think a tighter crop  up top would have removed the disorienting line of the windows.', '2008-10-09 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001374, 729319, 54645, '<td valign="top">What a great shot. I like the placement of the engineer, it really helps to convey the movement. I must admit that I''m really disappointed with the border, I think it''s going to hurt your score. Well done though.</td>', 'What a great shot. I like the placement of the engineer, it really helps to convey the movement. I must admit that I''m really disappointed with the border, I think it''s going to hurt your score. Well done though.', '2008-10-09 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
