(5001541, 729075, 26001, '<td valign="top">composition is excellent and exposure is perfect. subject/concept is simple, effective, to-the-point, and most importantly stylish. one of my favourites. 10</td>', 'composition is excellent and exposure is perfect. subject/concept is simple, effective, to-the-point, and most importantly stylish. one of my favourites. 10', '2008-10-09 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
