(5003403, 729070, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes a very good point. Most people don''t work in an office. For many years my office was the dashboard of my car.<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/yospiff/1659435165/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2119/1659435165_bcc6dc844b_t.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2119/1659435165_bcc6dc844b_t.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm3.static.flickr.com/2119/1659435165_bcc6dc844b_t.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Makes a very good point. Most people don''t work in an office. For many years my office was the dashboard of my car.', '2008-10-10 21:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003404, 729175, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great find!</td>', 'Great find!', '2008-10-10 21:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003413, 729235, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is a tough one. I''m riding the line on whether this is a unique interpretation, or just a shoehorned shot. I think it only marginally fits. Yes, it needs "work" but I think the spirit of the challenge would have been better done if someone was shown working on it. Without the title, it says "boat" to me, not "work". I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt on my vote, and won''t ding it. <b>Very</b> nice photo, however. Strong colors without being unrealistically enhanced.</td>', 'Oh, this is a tough one. I''m riding the line on whether this is a unique interpretation, or just a shoehorned shot. I think it only marginally fits. Yes, it needs "work" but I think the spirit of the challenge would have been better done if someone was shown working on it. Without the title, it says "boat" to me, not "work". I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt on my vote, and won''t ding it. Very nice photo, however. Strong colors without being unrealistically enhanced.', '2008-10-10 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003417, 729309, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a nice, juicy spider!</td>', 'What a nice, juicy spider!', '2008-10-10 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003423, 729233, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this really does not look very good. Lots of low contrast grainy artifacts. Looks like it has been clipped out of it''s background as well, which would be in violation of challenge rules.  It suits the topic, however.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this really does not look very good. Lots of low contrast grainy artifacts. Looks like it has been clipped out of it''s background as well, which would be in violation of challenge rules.  It suits the topic, however.', '2008-10-10 21:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003432, 728848, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yuck. Glad that''s not my line of work. As far as the photo goes, it strikes me as an average snapshot. Not sure what to suggest on this. It''s an interesting shot, actually, but I''m not sure you could do much with the lighting. Maybe a conversion to b/w? I''ve found that sometimes can help a shot that has bad lighting. Sorry to be so harsh on this effort.</td>', 'Yuck. Glad that''s not my line of work. As far as the photo goes, it strikes me as an average snapshot. Not sure what to suggest on this. It''s an interesting shot, actually, but I''m not sure you could do much with the lighting. Maybe a conversion to b/w? I''ve found that sometimes can help a shot that has bad lighting. Sorry to be so harsh on this effort.', '2008-10-10 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003436, 729046, 83313, '<td valign="top">Worker bees. Yup.</td>', 'Worker bees. Yup.', '2008-10-10 21:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003439, 729266, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and strong, but realistic color.</td>', 'Nice lighting and strong, but realistic color.', '2008-10-10 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003441, 728270, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it seems a little washed out and overexposed by just a touch. Could possibly benefit from some levels/curves adjustments.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it seems a little washed out and overexposed by just a touch. Could possibly benefit from some levels/curves adjustments.', '2008-10-10 21:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003447, 728375, 83313, '<td valign="top">What great detail and lighting on this! Reminds me of my own work. My fingers used to look like that when I worked as a field technician fixing copiers. I used lots of stuff that was hard on my hands, and couldn''t do any detailed work if I wore gloves. When I eventually transitioned to doing network integration, the nasty hands went away (and my wife was happier).<br/> <br/>My only nitpick is a bit of high ISO noise in the lower part of the frame. Not sure you could fix that in basic without killing some of the other details, however.</td>', 'What great detail and lighting on this! Reminds me of my own work. My fingers used to look like that when I worked as a field technician fixing copiers. I used lots of stuff that was hard on my hands, and couldn''t do any detailed work if I wore gloves. When I eventually transitioned to doing network integration, the nasty hands went away (and my wife was happier). My only nitpick is a bit of high ISO noise in the lower part of the frame. Not sure you could fix that in basic without killing some of the other details, however.', '2008-10-10 21:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003455, 729335, 83313, '<td valign="top">A wonderful entry and the title is fantastic! I think the title on it''s own is worth a high vote. Of course, we don''t vote on the title. I want to know how you did this sort of selective desat within basic editing rules.</td>', 'A wonderful entry and the title is fantastic! I think the title on it''s own is worth a high vote. Of course, we don''t vote on the title. I want to know how you did this sort of selective desat within basic editing rules.', '2008-10-10 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003457, 727875, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. This is interesting because, well, it''s similar to my own entry, so I certainly can''t critique the choice of subject any. I don''t think you had very good lighting to work with here, however. There''s a distracting object in the foreground as well. I think it''s the tip of a chair.</td>', 'Hmmm. This is interesting because, well, it''s similar to my own entry, so I certainly can''t critique the choice of subject any. I don''t think you had very good lighting to work with here, however. There''s a distracting object in the foreground as well. I think it''s the tip of a chair.', '2008-10-10 21:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003458, 727371, 83313, '<td valign="top">How many WPM can he do? Probably types faster and more accurately than I do. Could maybe benefit from slightly greater DOF, otherwise I really like this.</td>', 'How many WPM can he do? Probably types faster and more accurately than I do. Could maybe benefit from slightly greater DOF, otherwise I really like this.', '2008-10-10 21:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003461, 727381, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice b/w treatment and excellent use of motion blur.</td>', 'Very nice b/w treatment and excellent use of motion blur.', '2008-10-10 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5003462, 728388, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grapes? At first glance I thought it was dung. But that made no sense. Vintage dung? Nahhh. Photography-wise, I''m afraid I find this to be a good snapshot, though some adjustments could probably improve this. It''s got good basic material here.</td>', 'Grapes? At first glance I thought it was dung. But that made no sense. Vintage dung? Nahhh. Photography-wise, I''m afraid I find this to be a good snapshot, though some adjustments could probably improve this. It''s got good basic material here.', '2008-10-10 22:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
