(5005221, 729113, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines with the red ladder. Tree is interesting, although there''s a lot going on in theshot so the person gets lost a little. Still very interesting.</td>', 'Nice leading lines with the red ladder. Tree is interesting, although there''s a lot going on in theshot so the person gets lost a little. Still very interesting.', '2008-10-12 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
