(5005238, 728899, 64518, '<td valign="top">Too "staged" for me...hand positions, nothing on the paper, standard white background.  I think it''s a good idea and the model''s facial expression and hair are great.</td>', 'Too "staged" for me...hand positions, nothing on the paper, standard white background.  I think it''s a good idea and the model''s facial expression and hair are great.', '2008-10-12 17:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
