(5005247, 728551, 64518, '<td valign="top">This would have been higher (for me) if he was dirty..the clothes were less crisp, the table being something other than pressed wood, some sense of place...  <br/> <br/>I like the idea but too much "stage" for my tastes.<br/> <br/>That said, I like the lighting and detail ... technically a very good shot!</td>', 'This would have been higher (for me) if he was dirty..the clothes were less crisp, the table being something other than pressed wood, some sense of place...   I like the idea but too much "stage" for my tastes. That said, I like the lighting and detail ... technically a very good shot!', '2008-10-12 17:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
