(5007952, 729269, 96721, '<td valign="top">Yep looks like someone working to me, I like the B&amp;W conversion and the use of it here I think it works quite well.</td>', 'Yep looks like someone working to me, I like the B&W conversion and the use of it here I think it works quite well.', '2008-10-14 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007953, 729159, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!<br/> <br/>Looks like an AndrewT shot to me, the processing and colour of the water.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would like to see is the back of the bird but I suspect that might just be personal preference. I think you were unlucky that the light was so harsh at the front but the back looks almost shaded giving an almost overexposed look to the underside of the fish.</td>', 'Nice shot! Looks like an AndrewT shot to me, the processing and colour of the water. The only thing I would like to see is the back of the bird but I suspect that might just be personal preference. I think you were unlucky that the light was so harsh at the front but the back looks almost shaded giving an almost overexposed look to the underside of the fish.', '2008-10-14 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007954, 728270, 96721, '<td valign="top">Lacks a bit of contrast and could do with sharpening, might be a bit soft too.</td>', 'Lacks a bit of contrast and could do with sharpening, might be a bit soft too.', '2008-10-14 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007956, 729296, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice star on the light, quite a dramatic shot actually.<br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'Nice star on the light, quite a dramatic shot actually. Good job!', '2008-10-14 13:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007957, 729351, 96721, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the was shot through, looks almost as if it is layered (basic editing if so) or a photo / scan of an old image.<br/> <br/>Very grainy and can''t make up my mind about this one... I guess you could have shot into a VERY old and dirty mirror?<br/> <br/>Sorry I just can''t score this high.</td>', 'Not sure what the was shot through, looks almost as if it is layered (basic editing if so) or a photo / scan of an old image. Very grainy and can''t make up my mind about this one... I guess you could have shot into a VERY old and dirty mirror? Sorry I just can''t score this high.', '2008-10-14 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007958, 728848, 96721, '<td valign="top">Whilst this portrays work quite obviously, it''s all a bit too graphic for me and I suspect your votes will suffer because of it.<br/> <br/>It''s a well taken well exposed shot though.</td>', 'Whilst this portrays work quite obviously, it''s all a bit too graphic for me and I suspect your votes will suffer because of it. It''s a well taken well exposed shot though.', '2008-10-14 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
