(5007965, 728978, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/> <br/>I think you will get caned for the unnecessary body parts on display especially as your title suggests make up.</td>', 'Nice shot. I think you will get caned for the unnecessary body parts on display especially as your title suggests make up.', '2008-10-14 13:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007966, 727285, 96721, '<td valign="top">Oh dear LOL<br/> <br/>I suspect those legs would be covered up if he were to be doing that job regularly, almost looks like an advert straight out of a Gay Magazine.</td>', 'Oh dear LOL I suspect those legs would be covered up if he were to be doing that job regularly, almost looks like an advert straight out of a Gay Magazine.', '2008-10-14 13:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007967, 729041, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice water drops.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately so many spider and bee shots in this challenge it has taken the impact away of them (even the good ones), when a challenge gets saturated with shots of very similar subjects I think scores suffer for them too which is a shame, but I guess it encourages people to try and think out of the box a bit more?</td>', 'Nice water drops. Unfortunately so many spider and bee shots in this challenge it has taken the impact away of them (even the good ones), when a challenge gets saturated with shots of very similar subjects I think scores suffer for them too which is a shame, but I guess it encourages people to try and think out of the box a bit more?', '2008-10-14 13:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007968, 729135, 96721, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, suggests workout more than work but I consider a workout to be hard work anyway ;)<br/> <br/>I suspect this might be Timfy as it has that sort of lighting style.</td>', 'nice lighting, suggests workout more than work but I consider a workout to be hard work anyway ;) I suspect this might be Timfy as it has that sort of lighting style.', '2008-10-14 13:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
