(5008772, 729351, 61651, '<td valign="top">I''ve been waiting for your pinhole shots to appear...the noise seems to complement your subject, suggestive of all that dirty work involved.  I like your choice to only stay in the shot for 2/3rds of the exposure - interesting how some saw the wall of the barn as creases in a supposedly old photo.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''ve been waiting for your pinhole shots to appear...the noise seems to complement your subject, suggestive of all that dirty work involved.  I like your choice to only stay in the shot for 2/3rds of the exposure - interesting how some saw the wall of the barn as creases in a supposedly old photo.  Nice work.', '2008-10-15 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5008776, 729321, 67697, '<td valign="top">I totally get the exaggerated idea here lol.  Too bad for the literal voters.  I do agree tho about the light switch tho lol.  Are those sweat splotches on the drape too then?  Get this man to a doctor!!! hehe<br/> <br/>Good idea - guess you need to submit this to JPG too lol.<br/> <br/>I forgot to mention that I think your lighting and focus is good as well.  All around a good shot :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-15 00:21:32.</i></td>', 'I totally get the exaggerated idea here lol.  Too bad for the literal voters.  I do agree tho about the light switch tho lol.  Are those sweat splotches on the drape too then?  Get this man to a doctor!!! hehe Good idea - guess you need to submit this to JPG too lol. I forgot to mention that I think your lighting and focus is good as well.  All around a good shot :)', '2008-10-15 01:21:01.000000', '2008-10-15 01:21:32.000000', 0),
