(5008994, 729175, 78303, '<td valign="top">True, but see if you can find "wore-out" before the entry of "work" in just any dictionary.  315,000 + words in that copy I had and I just found it funny the two were side by side.  Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mark-A:</b></div><hr/><i> A little over used and old hat now, I think the whole dictionary thing with a subject as varied as work is a bit to lazy.<br/> <br/>Nice focus, good DOF and pretty good lighting though so I can''t score you too low.<br/> <br/>4 </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'True, but see if you can find "wore-out" before the entry of "work" in just any dictionary.  315,000 + words in that copy I had and I just found it funny the two were side by side.  Thanks for the comments. Originally posted by Mark-A: A little over used and old hat now, I think the whole dictionary thing with a subject as varied as work is a bit to lazy. Nice focus, good DOF and pretty good lighting though so I can''t score you too low. 4 ', '2008-10-15 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
