(5010217, 729187, 98770, '<td valign="top">I did use a tripod and the original image is really sharp. Something went very wrong when I resized the image for the contest. It''s my first entry and I never resized an image that much. I was quite late with the entry so I guess I was sort of hoping that it wouldn''t be that bad. It is though :P I did some researche and I know what I did wrong so next time no blurry image from me! Thnks a lot for all your comments by the way. About the composition: I''m really chaotic especially while studying and this is just how my desk looks :P could have made it better for the photo though.</td>', 'I did use a tripod and the original image is really sharp. Something went very wrong when I resized the image for the contest. It''s my first entry and I never resized an image that much. I was quite late with the entry so I guess I was sort of hoping that it wouldn''t be that bad. It is though :P I did some researche and I know what I did wrong so next time no blurry image from me! Thnks a lot for all your comments by the way. About the composition: I''m really chaotic especially while studying and this is just how my desk looks :P could have made it better for the photo though.', '2008-10-15 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
