(5015526, 728968, 90387, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comment Dave. It''s hard for me to be mad about getting fourth when the three ahead of it are as excellent as they are! :-)  I read your photographers comments and had to grin a bit.  A few months ago I was desperately trying to break into the 6''s as well, and then BAM, blue ribbon. (almost the same score as yours) Now 6.0 is my new personal benchmark of "success." lol    Glad you accomplished your initial goal, and here''s to many more like it!</td>', 'Thanks for your comment Dave. It''s hard for me to be mad about getting fourth when the three ahead of it are as excellent as they are! :-)  I read your photographers comments and had to grin a bit.  A few months ago I was desperately trying to break into the 6''s as well, and then BAM, blue ribbon. (almost the same score as yours) Now 6.0 is my new personal benchmark of "success." lol    Glad you accomplished your initial goal, and here''s to many more like it!', '2008-10-20 06:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5015543, 728968, 82707, '<td valign="top">I was very excited for me, when I last left a comment on your image.  I''ve just come back for a browse, and realised that when you break a barrier, you you do it with gusto - 5.9 to 6.9 That''s impressive, and I don''t think it happens too often on DPC...so again ''Well Done!''..the trouble with that is now you have to live up to it...and I''m sure you can, with that new equipment!  :)</td>', 'I was very excited for me, when I last left a comment on your image.  I''ve just come back for a browse, and realised that when you break a barrier, you you do it with gusto - 5.9 to 6.9 That''s impressive, and I don''t think it happens too often on DPC...so again ''Well Done!''..the trouble with that is now you have to live up to it...and I''m sure you can, with that new equipment!  :)', '2008-10-20 07:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
